diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 399a783..a4d8ad2 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,4 +6,11 @@ Shares one composite action across the repository's workflows.
 
 | Action | Purpose |
 |--------|---------|
-| `actions/setup-toolchain` | Installs the toolchain and restores the build cache. |
+| `actions/setup-toolchain` | Installs the toolchain, lints with ruff, and restores the build cache (keyed on OS, version, and `uv.lock`). |
+
+## Workflows
+
+| Workflow | Job | Runner | Purpose |
+|----------|-----|--------|---------|
+| `ci` | `test` | `ubuntu-latest` | Runs `actions/setup-toolchain` and the test suite. |
+| `ci` | `test-windows` | `windows-latest` | Runs `actions/setup-toolchain` and the test suite. |
